{"file": "film_council__film-council-members-osnat-bukofzer__manual.md", "url": "manual://film-council/members/osnat-bukofzer", "source_name": "film_council", "status": "ok", "content_hash": "611a4591cb98da4960cae95854a9cf86", "content_length": 523, "filter_info": {"reason": "manual_canonical_source"}, "truncated": false, "elapsed_sec": 0, "data": {"metadata": {"source_url": "manual://film-council/members/osnat-bukofzer", "source_name": "film_council", "extraction_date": "2026-05-24", "language": "he", "canonical_source": "FIW articles Nov 2023 + Apr 2024; Film Council member (term ~2012-2017, unconfirmed); OSINT 2026-05-24"}, "entities": {"people": {"person_001": {"name_he": "אסנת בוקופצר", "name_en": "Osnat Bukofzer", "aliases": [], "primary_roles": ["board_member"], "gender": "f", "notes": "חברת מועצת הקולנוע (בערך 2012–2017, מתוך מאמרי FIW). כיהנה כיו\"ר ועדת שיווק בינלאומי. ניגוד עניינים: עבדה בתפקיד יח\"צ/פוסט-פרודקשן על [בבא ג'ון (2015)](https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baba_Joon) בעת כהונתה במועצה. הסרט מומן ע\"י קרן רבינוביץ + קרן גשר + קרן נזריאן, זכה בפרס אופיר 2015. לאחר תום הכהונה: מנהלת ענייני בינלאומי וקופרודוקציה בקרן רבינוביץ מ-2017 ([cinemaproject.org.il](https://www.cinemaproject.org.il)).", "sources": ["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Baba_Joon", "https://www.screendaily.com/news/homeland-star-joins-baba-joon/5071728.article", "manual://osint/fiw-articles-2026-05-24"]}}, "organizations": {}, "films": {}, "events": {}}, "roles": [], "relationships": []}}
{"file": "film_council__film-council-members-aryeh-cherner__manual.md", "url": "manual://film-council/members/aryeh-cherner", "source_name": "film_council", "status": "ok", "content_hash": "1879450d3367176abb210ec882a94e4c", "content_length": 1026, "filter_info": {"reason": "manual_canonical_source"}, "truncated": false, "elapsed_sec": 0, "data": {"metadata": {"source_url": "manual://film-council/members/aryeh-cherner", "source_name": "film_council", "extraction_date": "2026-05-24", "language": "he", "canonical_source": "Wikidata Q12404260 + IMDB; FIW article Apr 2024; OSINT 2026-05-24"}, "entities": {"people": {"person_001": {"name_he": "אריה צ'רנר", "name_en": "Aryeh Cherner", "aliases": ["Arie Tcherner"], "primary_roles": ["board_member", "actor"], "gender": "m", "birth_year": 1957, "birth_place": "Ramla, Israel", "notes": "Israeli actor and voice actor. Film Council member since 2012 (Wikidata). Beit Zvi graduate; Khan Theater from 1981. Israeli Theater Award 2009 (Actor of Year). Known for dubbing: Mufasa (Lion King 2019), Hagrid (Harry Potter), Gusteau (Ratatouille). FIW allegation: participated as actor in multiple funded films while serving on Film Council (2014-2019): 'Circles' (2014, IFF), 'Paper Wedding' (2015, Gesher/Makor/IFF), 'Capo in Jerusalem' (2015, Jerusalem Fund/IFF/Gesher), 'The Rooms of the House' (2016), 'Foxtrot' (2016), 'Makatub' (2017), 'Lady Titi' (2018), 'Voice Over' (2018), 'Shakhim' (2019). Films funded by Rabinovich, IFF, Gesher, Jerusalem Fund, NFCT.", "sources": ["https://www.wikidata.org/wiki/Q12404260", "https://www.imdb.com/name/nm0155888/", "manual://osint/fiw-articles-2026-05-24"]}}, "organizations": {}, "films": {}, "events": {}}, "roles": [], "relationships": []}}
